@base = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Providers (safe to expose)
GET {{base}}/api/ai/providers

### 2. Diagnostics — providers + key status + languages (no secrets)
GET {{base}}/api/ai/info

### 3. Current provider selection
GET {{base}}/api/ai/selection

### 4. Switch chat provider live (Echo | KnowledgeBase | OpenAiCompatible)
POST {{base}}/api/ai/selection
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatProvider": "Echo",
  "translationProvider": null
}

### 5. Non-streaming chat (envelope: success/data/error/traceId)
POST {{base}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "what are your services?"
}

### 6. Chat with history + session + requested language
POST {{base}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "and pricing?",
  "history": [{ "role": "user", "content": "hi" }],
  "sessionId": "demo-1",
  "responseLanguage": "ta"
}

### 7. Streaming chat (SSE — use a terminal: curl -N)
# curl -N -X POST {{base}}/api/ai/chat/stream -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"message\":\"hi\"}"

### 8. Translate text
POST {{base}}/api/ai/translation/translate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Good morning",
  "targetLanguage": "ta"
}

### 9. Batch translate (1-100 texts)
POST {{base}}/api/ai/translation/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "texts": ["Good morning", "Thank you"],
  "targetLanguage": "es"
}

### 10. Detect language
POST {{base}}/api/ai/translation/detect-language
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Vanakkam"
}

### 11. Supported languages
GET {{base}}/api/ai/translation/languages

### 12. Validation demo — unknown language (expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR envelope)
POST {{base}}/api/ai/translation/translate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "hi",
  "targetLanguage": "xx"
}

### 13. Validation demo — unknown provider (expect 400 UNKNOWN_PROVIDER)
POST {{base}}/api/ai/selection
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatProvider": "Nope"
}
